            "sha256": "556052019b1a91ae786f0d22ef28dadab47d5f3217b4a50a54460fb79ba17987",
            "start": 970,
            "end": 1079,
            "quote": "## 4. [昇腾NPU运维故障排查实战：npu-smi诊断、训练卡死、通信异常处理](https://www.zdyedu.cn/blog/ascend-npu-ops-troubleshooting-guide/)",
