            "field": "content",
            "sha256": "f76134815fbcdc057912b2857e531da876cd38c7bdf23991d497d4333687e4c5",
            "start": 1130,
            "end": 1217,
            "quote": "我较有把握的键是 `max_split_size_mb`（限制可切分的最大块，缓解碎片）和 `garbage_collection_threshold`（触发缓存回收的阈值）",
            "json_escaped": false
          },
          {
            "id": "ev-17",
            "event_id": "client-note-00005",
            "field": "content",
            "sha256": "f76134815fbcdc057912b2857e531da876cd38c7bdf23991d497d4333687e4c5",
            "start": 658,
            "end": 849,
            "quote": "用 `torch.npu.memory_summary()`、`torch.npu.memory_allocated()`、`torch.npu.max_memory_allocated()`、`torch.npu.memory_reserved()`、`torch.npu.reset_peak_memory_stats()` 定位峰值来源（注意：这些接口名我并非 100% 确定",
            "json_escaped": false
          },
          {
            "id": "ev-18",
            "event_id": "run-end",
            "field": "answer",
            "sha256": "4c74327b944de2780d0d8eafa8bfba4d9f88996a2a2f89b0f89eee634abdfb3c",
            "start": 6668,
            "end": 6768,
            "quote": "`expandable_segments`：需 Ascend HDK ≥23.0.0；且与 `max_split_size_mb`/`garbage_collection_threshold` 互斥。",
            "json_escaped": false
          },
          {
